  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/tarball/v3.27.1",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/zipball/v3.27.1",
  "body": "## Highlights\n\nPatch for the v3.27.0 Grok Bot native X launch, from a smoke test on Grok Bot. (#1237)\n\n- The month's most-engaged on-topic X posts now reach the report. Host-fetched X holds half its slots for its biggest posts that name the topic, so the popular pass's big posts no longer lose to fresher low-engagement ones. Off-topic viral posts never take those slots, and posts from the handles you name are never pushed out.\n- The footer's X line now says where X came from: \"via Grok Bot X\" or \"via X connector\".\n- The Grok Bot X recipe gives discovered authors only topic-word searches and uses the engine's UTC date for the window.\n\nUpdate: `grok plugin update last30days`, `claude plugin update last30days`, or re-run `npx skills add mvanhorn/last30days-skill -g -y`.\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(x): keep the month's most-engaged Grok Bot X posts in the report by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1237\n* chore(release): bump version to 3.27.1 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1239\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/compare/v3.27.0...v3.27.1\n",
